  "bodyHash": "be5a2cb042d57fad",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#0cf\">Fast Paintings</span><br></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/qdKRTDf8Cv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790151253144895508?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Discord&\" alt=\"补充内容 Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mehvahdjukaar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=mehvahdjukaar&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge&label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitter.com/Supplementariez\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/Supplementariez?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Twitter&message=Twitter&\" alt=\"补充内容 Twitter\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Youtube&message=Twitter&logoColor=ff0000\" alt=\"补充内容 YouTube\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UpMHfZ5.png\" width=\"1519\" height=\"37\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>📖 简介 📖</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">不仅仅是一个性能优化模组。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">功能：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">画作渲染无卡顿</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">画作更新无卡顿</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可自定义的画作模型</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">粒子效果</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">环境光遮蔽</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">支撑方块被破坏时反应更快</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">远离时画作不会消失</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">使用 mipmap 使画作外观更清晰</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">不再因使用 kill 命令误杀画作</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">换句话说，Fast Paintings 是一款<strong>性能优化</strong>模组，它优化了画作的渲染速度，使其快得多</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><br>为此，该模组只是将它们替换为对应的方块形式。<br>方块画作将使用烘焙模型而非实体渲染器，从而达到<strong>尽可能快的速度</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">此外，它们现在只是普通方块，因此画作实体更新带来的卡顿也随之消失！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">这种方法还使得当你破坏其支撑方块时，画作会立即更新，同时也让它们能够拥有粒子效果</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此外，它还兼具<strong>装饰性</strong>模组的功能，因为它允许你通过资源包覆盖其 JSON 模型来完全自定义画作模型。你可以实现复杂的效果，比如在周围添加木质边框。很酷吧！<br>要实现这一点，只需编辑模型，在每个部分中包含一个 JSON 或引用模型即可（例如，“top_left”用于应用到左上角）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br>另外不用担心，你仍然可以穿过它们。暗门万岁！</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">正在寻找使用该模组自定义画作模型功能的材质包？不用找了！<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/framed-paintings-fast-paintings-custom-model\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/955/46/638446800683802696.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a><br></span></span></p>\n<h5>&nbsp;</h5>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UpMHfZ5.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>❤️支持我❤️</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">模组开发占用了大量时间，如果你喜欢我的工作并希望支持我，可以在这里进行。支持后，你将获得专属定制的 <strong>Globe</strong> 或 <strong>Statue</strong>！如果你使用优惠码“supplementaries”在 Akliz 购买服务器，同样适用。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/mehvahdjukaar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sroRu1I.png\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\" width=\"346\" height=\"68\"></a></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\">需要服务器？看看 Akliz，他们专为模组版 Minecraft 提供顶级品牌服务器。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\">他们拥有非常友好的社区和优质的客服支持，服务器体验极佳。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">使用优惠码“supplementaries”可享<strong>&nbsp;八折优惠</strong>&nbsp;，同时也能支持我！</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g5B76A8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"150\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmehvahdjukaar.github.io%252fMcPerformanceMods%252f%2523setup\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZxxbOvz.png\" alt=\"Optifine 并不好\" width=\"1000\" height=\"178\"></span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UpMHfZ5.png\" width=\"1519\" height=\"37\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🦉 我们的其他模组🦉</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/haunted-harvest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/769/890/638107786158633425.gif\" alt=\"Haunted Harvest\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snowy-spirit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/488/371/637792657482121666.png\" alt=\"Snowy Spirit\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/labels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/623/301/638017052310334649.png\" alt=\"储物标签\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/goated\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/767/944/638104301571813998.png\" alt=\"Goated\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-oak-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/628/707/638025814904126005.gif\" alt=\"神秘橡树\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carpeted-stairs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/658/179/638058347698730749.png\" alt=\"地毯楼梯\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/727/100/638080208599452100.png\" alt=\"MmmMmmMmmMmm\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moyai\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/490/709/637798404029150212.png\" alt=\"Moyai\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/438/886/637685255314420532.png\" alt=\"JEED\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-lily-pads\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/551/229/637888507256267100.png\" alt=\"更好的睡莲\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancement-frames\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/774/798/638115339656250649.png\" alt=\"进度框架\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/randomium-ore\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/774/800/638115342928765853.png\" alt=\"随机矿脉\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a> </span></span></p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>",
